Description: PolarOS system administration toolset
 Meta package that pulls in the complete PolarOS package set: base system
 utilities, networking and remote access, monitoring and diagnostics,
 maintenance and backup, security, scripting helpers and ARM firmware.
 .
 Installing this package turns a minimal Debian ARM64 system into PolarOS.
